   "source": [
    "# 5. Check the class distribution\n",
    "\n",
    "Because this is a medical classification problem, I also check how many examples belong to each class in each split.\n",
    "\n",
    "This gives context for the later accuracy, precision, recall, and calibration results.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "3aab31a7-c16c-4ffc-ae4b-a561ab679d81",
   "metadata": {},
